{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在探索一種利用普通消費者電腦閒置算力訓練人工智能模型的方式。根據近日公開的一份專利申請，微軟提出建立一個分佈式計算網絡，將大型AI模型訓練任務拆分成大量小型任務，分配給處於空閒狀態的遊戲電腦、筆記本電腦，甚至智能手機。願意提供設備算力的用户，則可能獲得積分、免費軟件、AI模型使用權限，甚至現金報酬。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585710.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.147760+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:59:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"c56681a273b71c137f961359b20f2c3c0c87bd089530d01ccaaf4b78d173c931","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}